#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>this day<else>this eve</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/006/SubSea014_00662:TEXT_SUBSEA014_00662_OKALKAYA_000_1:1"
msgid "Cap'n Rhoswen's in no mood to be entertainin' customers <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>this eve<else>this morn'</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>this day<else>this eve</if></if>, an' even when she is, she ain't particularly good at it."
msgstr "Капитан Росвен <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>сегодня вечером<else>сегодня утром</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>днём<else>вечером</if></if> не до гостей, а когда ей до них есть дело — она всё равно никудышная хозяйка."

#. ja: いや、待て待て待てよ……<br>あんたなら、頭領の機嫌を直せるかもしれないねえ。
#. de: Ach, warte mal ... Du könntest ihre Laune vielleicht bessern.
#. fr: Ah, mais attends une minute... En fait, tu pourrais bien êtrrre le remède qu'il nous faut pour calmer Rhoswen.
#. speaker: OKALKAYA
msgctxt "quest/006/SubSea014_00662:TEXT_SUBSEA014_00662_OKALKAYA_000_2:1"
msgid "Though...maybe dealin' with a customer's the sort o' shite what might shake 'er from 'er doldrums."
msgstr "Хотя… может, возня с посетителем как раз и вытащит её из уныния."

#. ja: ためしに、この酒場「永遠の乙女亭」にいる<br>頭領「ローズウェン」様に「ひざまず」いて挨拶してみな。<br>この都市の新参者として、敬意を示すんだよ。
#. de: Geh ruhig in die Ewige Jungfer, aber zeig Rhoswen zuerst deinen Respekt, indem du dich niederkniest. Sonst kann ich nicht für deine Gesundheit garantieren.
#. fr: Comme tu as l'air nouve<if $gn4>lle<else>au</if> ici, tu ferrrais bien d'aller la saluer en <i>t'agenouillant</i> devant elle.
#. speaker: OKALKAYA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
